                    PostgreSQL 16 Cloud Activo
                </span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2.5 relative z-10 shrink-0">
            <a href="http://35.206.81.32:8080" target="_blank" class="btn bg-white/15 dark:bg-slate-800/80 hover:bg-white/25 dark:hover:bg-slate-700 text-white font-semibold border border-white/25 dark:border-slate-700 rounded-2xl backdrop-blur-md px-4 text-xs h-11">
                🗄️ Adminer BD
